      "notes_text": "<table border=\"1\"><colgroup><col></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>CAMP ACTIVITY</strong></h3>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">1. <strong>Combat Lesson</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Once before the next rest, after making an Accuracy Check or a Magic Check for an<br>offensive spell (r), the target may add a bonus of +4 to the Result of the Check.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">2.<strong>Training</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Once before the next rest, if you are about to suffer one or more status effects from<br>the same source, you may instead choose not to suffer any of those status effects.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: auto;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<h3><strong>HEROIC STYLE SKILLS</strong></h3>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>AGILE DEFENDER STYLE</strong><br>Requirements: you must have Skill Level 2 or higher in Dodge (see Rogue).<br>As long as you have no shields and no martial armor equipped, you gain all of the<br>following benefits:<br>w <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">You may ignore the MP cost of the Provoke Skill (see Fury)</span>.<br>w <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">You may ignore the MP cost of the Peacock Dance (see Dancer).</span><br>w <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">You may use the Protect Skill (see Guardian) even if you have not acquired it.</span><br>w <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Your Magic Defense score is increased by 【your Skill Level in Dodge】.</span><br><strong>Additionally, your maximum Hit Points and Crisis score are now calculated based on</strong><br><strong>your base Dexterity die size, instead of your base Might die size.</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: auto;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<h2>QUIRKS : SURVIVOR&nbsp;</h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<table style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: auto;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>You are among the few who survived a natural catastrophe or the attack of a dreadful<br>creature. Do you believe someone is responsible for this? Were you able to keep in<br>contact with any other survivors? Do you think it possible to rebuild?<br>Permanently <strong>increase your maximum Hit Points and maximum Mind Points by 5.</strong><br>Choose one option: <strong>gain the ability to equip martial melee and ranged weapons,</strong><br><strong>martial armor, and martial shields; or learn any one spell from the Elementalist or</strong><br><strong>Spiritist lists; or permanently increase your maximum Inventory Points by 2.</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>",
      "off_attrib_1": "SHI",
      "off_attrib_2": "SHI",
      "off_base_mod_1": "0",
      "off_base_mod_2": "0",
      "off_hand": "",
      "off_hand_attack": "",
      "off_mod_1": 0,
      "off_mod_2": 0,
      "origin": "",
      "passive_list": {
        "0": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "passive_description": "<p>You are among the few who survived a natural catastrophe or the attack of a dreadful<br>creature. Do you believe someone is responsible for this? Were you able to keep in<br>contact with any other survivors? Do you think it possible to rebuild?<br>Permanently&nbsp;<strong>increase your maximum Hit Points and maximum Mind Points by 5.</strong><br>Choose one option:&nbsp;<strong>gain the ability to equip martial melee and ranged weapons,</strong><br><strong>martial armor, and martial shields; or learn any one spell from the Elementalist or</strong><br><strong>Spiritist lists; or permanently increase your maximum Inventory Points by 2.</strong></p>",
          "passive_name": "SURVIVOR ",
          "passive_roll": "",
          "passive_source": "quirk"
        },
        "1": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "passive_description": "<p>Once before the next rest, after making an Accuracy Check or a Magic Check for an<br>offensive spell (r), the target may add a bonus of +4 to the Result of the Check.</p>",
          "passive_name": "Combat Lesson",
          "passive_roll": "",
          "passive_source": "camp activity"
        },
        "2": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "passive_description": "<p>Once before the next rest, if you are about to suffer one or more status effects from<br>the same source, you may instead choose not to suffer any of those status effects.</p>",
          "passive_name": "Training",
          "passive_roll": "",
          "passive_source": "camp activity"
        }
      },
